---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

interface GuideSection { id: string; eyebrow: string; title: string; summary: string; points?: string[] }
interface Props { title: string; deck: string; category: string; sections: GuideSection[]; updated: string; author: string; relatedHref: string; relatedLabel: string }
const { title, deck, category, sections, updated, author, relatedHref, relatedLabel } = Astro.props;
---
<BaseLayout title={`${title} — evergreen guide pilot`} sidebar={true} relatedTopic="football">
  <article class="evergreen-guide">
    <nav class="guide-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/pilot/home/">EveryTip</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/pilot/betting-guides/">Betting guides</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span>{category}</span></nav>
    <header class="guide-hero">
      <p class="kicker">{category} · evergreen guide pilot</p>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p class="guide-deck">{deck}</p>
      <div class="guide-meta"><span>By {author}</span><span>Editorial snapshot: {updated}</span><span>8 min guide layout</span></div>
    </header>
    <p class="guide-warning"><strong>Preview content only.</strong> This page demonstrates an editable guide structure, not a claim that any strategy makes betting profitable. Eric will review each factual claim, example, image, link and original paragraph before migration.</p>
    <div class="guide-intro"><div><p class="kicker">Start here</p><h2>The answer in brief</h2><p>Each selection added to an accumulator introduces another way for the bet to lose. A useful guide should explain the mechanism, the trade-offs and the bookmaker’s rules clearly before discussing any tactic. The final wording and examples remain WordPress editorial content.</p></div><div class="guide-definition"><strong>Editable content, stable layout</strong><span>Headings, paragraphs, links, tables, callouts and FAQs are content blocks; Astro controls their visual system.</span></div></div>
    <nav class="guide-toc" aria-label="On this page"><strong>In this guide</strong>{sections.map(({ id, title }) => <a href={`#${id}`}>{title}</a>)}<a href="#guide-faq">Questions</a></nav>
    <div class="guide-body">{sections.map((section, index) => <section id={section.id} class="guide-section"><p class="guide-step">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} / {section.eyebrow}</p><h2>{section.title}</h2><p>{section.summary}</p>{section.points && <ul>{section.points.map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}</ul>}{index === 1 && <aside class="guide-example"><strong>Worked-example block</strong><p>A dated, clearly hypothetical example can show how combined decimal odds and possible returns are calculated. The final guide should also state that the entire stake can be lost and should not imply that an accumulator is likely to win.</p></aside>}</section>)}</div>
    <aside class="guide-related"><div><p class="kicker">Keep reading</p><h2>Tips are separate from the guide</h2><p>The guide stays evergreen. Current football selections, with their own dates and provenance, live in the tips hub rather than being copied into this page.</p><a href={relatedHref}>{relatedLabel} →</a></div><div class="guide-offer-slot"><strong>Optional offer slot</strong><span>Only shown if an approved, current ACF offer is linked. The offer and compact/full terms share one record.</span></div></aside>
    <section id="guide-faq" class="guide-faq"><p class="kicker">Reader questions</p><h2>Football accumulator FAQs</h2><details><summary>What is an accumulator?</summary><p>It combines two or more selections into one bet. Every selection must meet the bookmaker’s settlement rules for the accumulator to win. Final wording should be fact-checked before publication.</p></details><details><summary>Where do the rules come from?</summary><p>Specific eligibility, void, cash-out and bonus conditions must be checked against the current operator rules. They are not hard-coded into the guide design.</p></details></section>
    <footer class="guide-footer">Editorial copy and SEO metadata remain editable in WordPress. Reusable offers, where appropriate, come from centrally managed ACF records. 18+ · Gamble responsibly.</footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .evergreen-guide{color:#263b4d}.guide-crumb{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:17px;color:#647b8c;font-size:12px}.guide-hero{padding:25px;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#e9f3fa,#fff);border-top:5px solid var(--et-orange)}.guide-hero h1{margin:3px 0 10px}.guide-deck{max-width:720px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}.guide-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:17px}.guide-meta span{background:#fff;padding:6px 9px;color:#48677e;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}.guide-warning{background:#fff4e9;border-left:4px solid var(--et-orange);padding:13px 15px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.guide-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 210px;gap:18px;align-items:start;margin-top:26px}.guide-intro h2{margin:3px 0 8px}.guide-intro p:not(.kicker){max-width:660px}.guide-definition{display:grid;gap:7px;background:#eaf3f8;border-top:4px solid var(--et-blue);padding:16px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.guide-definition strong{color:#164f79}.guide-toc{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:24px 0 4px;padding:13px;border:1px solid #d6e4ed;background:#fff}.guide-toc strong{flex-basis:100%;font-size:12px;color:#194b6d}.guide-toc a{padding:6px 8px;background:#eaf3f9;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:750}.guide-body{max-width:790px}.guide-section{padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5eb;scroll-margin-top:20px}.guide-section h2{margin:3px 0 9px}.guide-section p,.guide-section li{line-height:1.6}.guide-section li{margin:6px 0}.guide-step{margin:0;color:#ad5100;font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}.guide-example{margin:16px 0;padding:16px;background:#ecf5fa;border-left:4px solid var(--et-blue)}.guide-example p{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px}.guide-related{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 190px;gap:18px;margin:28px 0;padding:20px;background:#e9f3fa;border-left:4px solid var(--et-orange)}.guide-related h2{margin:4px 0 8px}.guide-related p:not(.kicker){font-size:13px}.guide-related a{font-weight:800}.guide-offer-slot{display:grid;align-content:center;gap:7px;padding:15px;background:#fff;font-size:12px}.guide-offer-slot span{color:#5d7080}.guide-faq{margin-top:26px;scroll-margin-top:20px}.guide-faq h2{margin:3px 0 10px}.guide-faq details{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5eb}.guide-faq summary{cursor:pointer;color:#1c5b8a;font-weight:800}.guide-faq details p{font-size:13px}.guide-footer{border-top:1px solid #dce5eb;padding:14px 0;margin-top:30px;color:#627b8c;font-size:11px}@media(max-width:650px){.guide-hero{padding:20px 15px}.guide-deck{font-size:15px}.guide-intro,.guide-related{grid-template-columns:1fr}.guide-toc{gap:6px}.guide-toc a{font-size:11px}}
</style>
